-what already happened. Non-blocking on failure (log + proceed to Step 6); never edit an
-existing charter marker.
+**When `issue_ref` is present**, run exactly this (it is idempotent — exits immediately if the
+charter marker already exists — and never blocks; report its one-line stdout):
